            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A few can. It needs native 240V output for most submersible pumps and enough surge capacity for the pump's start. The Anker SOLIX F3800 and EcoFlow Delta Pro 3 produce 120/240V. Check their published surge ratings against your pump maker's table, and consider soft start for 1 HP and larger pumps. Most smaller stations cannot do this job."
          }
        },
